      "content": "It's as if you've created a self-imposed isolation that's more suffocating than liberating. Your feelings of disconnection from the world and its expectations can feel suffocating, and it's understandable that you're feeling trapped. Acknowledge that you don't have to have all the answers right now and that it's okay to let yourself feel this way. Allow yourself to stay in this state, and try to focus on survival and small moments of comfort, rather than rushing to escape or re-engage with a world that no longer feels familiar.",
